01:15:06,780 --> 01:15:08,810
through the atmospheric chain.

2337
01:15:08,810 --> 01:15:10,330
-Oh, you're here.

2338
01:15:10,330 --> 01:15:13,530
-But my moon is the destroyer,
 so everything possible

2339
01:15:13,530 --> 01:15:15,090
will be done.

2340
01:15:15,090 --> 01:15:16,800
-Prepare my spaceship at once.

2341
01:15:16,800 --> 01:15:17,900
-Prepare this.

2342
01:15:17,900 --> 01:15:19,980
-Atlasan and I will wait
 until Posita is evacuated,

2343
01:15:19,980 --> 01:15:22,450
and then resume
 the bombardments.

2344
01:15:22,450 --> 01:15:23,710
-Oh, no, Cleolanta.

2345
01:15:23,710 --> 01:15:24,740
-You get back up to your room.

2346
01:15:24,740 --> 01:15:27,260
-Rick and I will be on the
 spaceship with you and Atlasan.

2347
01:15:27,260 --> 01:15:29,610
I'll give the order to
 start the bombardment.

2348
01:15:29,610 --> 01:15:30,530
Oh, Winky.

2349
01:15:30,530 --> 01:15:31,220
-Aah!

2350
01:15:31,220 --> 01:15:33,010
-You and Vena will
 control the Orbit Jet

2351
01:15:33,010 --> 01:15:34,640
under Secretary Drake's command.

2352
01:15:34,640 --> 01:15:35,140
-Aye, aye, sir.

2353
01:15:35,140 --> 01:15:36,880
-He and her?

2354
01:15:36,880 --> 01:15:38,710
-Word will be sent to
 all available spaceships

2355
01:15:38,710 --> 01:15:41,170
to standby to aid in the
 evacuation of Ophecious.

2356
01:15:41,170 --> 01:15:41,670
-Ew!

2357
01:15:41,670 --> 01:15:42,170
-Ick!

2358
01:15:42,170 --> 01:15:45,200
-In case the bombardment fails.

2359
01:15:45,200 --> 01:15:45,980
Professor?

2360
01:15:45,980 --> 01:15:46,740
-Uh, I'm not dead yet.

2361
01:15:46,740 --> 01:15:48,730
-Yes, Rocky.

2362
01:15:48,730 --> 01:15:51,380
-You'll come with me to see
 if the bombardment shocks

2363
01:15:51,380 --> 01:15:52,270
Posita from its orbit.

2364
01:15:52,270 --> 01:15:53,190
-Yes.

2365
01:15:53,190 --> 01:15:54,390
-Hey, Rocky.

2366
01:15:54,390 --> 01:15:57,490
-No one hugged me today.

2367
01:15:57,490 --> 01:16:00,110
-Bobby, you're a bad person,
 and nobody likes you.

2368
01:16:00,110 --> 01:16:01,780
-Board the Orbit Jet.

2369
01:16:01,780 --> 01:16:06,120
[BABY CRYING]

2370
01:16:06,120 --> 01:16:07,090
-Oh, no!

2371
01:16:07,090 --> 01:16:10,920
-Little prince, what's
 bothering you this time?

2372
01:16:10,920 --> 01:16:11,560
-Your head.

2373
01:16:14,180 --> 01:16:15,970
-If you could only talk!

2374
01:16:15,970 --> 01:16:18,120
-If you could only act.

2375
01:16:18,120 --> 01:16:18,620
-Hey!

2376
01:16:18,620 --> 01:16:19,750
Maybe it's over now!

2377
01:16:19,750 --> 01:16:20,710
We can out quick and and--

2378
01:16:20,710 --> 01:16:21,360
-Uh, oh.

2379
01:16:21,360 --> 01:16:22,330
It was a storm.

2380
01:16:26,430 --> 01:16:27,840
-Epilogue 45.

2381
01:16:27,840 --> 01:16:29,860
-How is the little
 nipper, Martha?

2382
01:16:29,860 --> 01:16:34,250
-The last plane to
 Nagato is leaving.

2383
01:16:34,250 --> 01:16:35,690
-"Sophie's Choice."

2384
01:16:35,690 --> 01:16:37,130
-Oh, Nicolette.

2385
01:16:37,130 --> 01:16:40,480
[BABY CRYING]

2386
01:16:40,480 --> 01:16:41,280
-Oh, brother!

2387
01:16:45,450 --> 01:16:47,190
-But there was no
 room in the inn.

2388
01:16:47,190 --> 01:16:50,320
Then the space Joseph and
 Mary took the tiny infant

2389
01:16:50,320 --> 01:16:51,720
to space Bethlehem.

2390
01:16:51,720 --> 01:16:53,090
And that was when they--

2391
01:16:53,090 --> 01:16:57,460
-Such a fine, little prince to
 be raised without a land rule.

2392
01:16:57,460 --> 01:17:00,530
Come, Potonda, I must
 prepare the flare signal.

2393
01:17:00,530 --> 01:17:05,420
It will tell Rocky the
 evacuation is complete.

2394
01:17:05,420 --> 01:17:07,720
[BABY CRYING]

2395
01:17:07,720 --> 01:17:09,540
-Oh, I've had this
 happen before.

2396
01:17:09,540 --> 01:17:10,040
[CHUCKLING]

2397
01:17:10,040 --> 01:17:12,030
-Yep.

2398
01:17:12,030 --> 01:17:15,490
Slug bug, anybody?

2399
01:17:15,490 --> 01:17:17,380
-Hmm, mm, mm.

2400
01:17:17,380 --> 01:17:18,790
[WHISTLING]

2401
01:17:18,790 --> 01:17:20,670
-Ooh, aah!

2402
01:17:20,670 --> 01:17:23,320
An effect!

2403
01:17:23,320 --> 01:17:28,950
-Professor, Vena has just
 signalled complete evacuation.

2404
01:17:28,950 --> 01:17:31,650
-Uh, no, that's just
 a serial number.

2405
01:17:31,650 --> 01:17:33,040
-Watch carefully, Professor.

2406
01:17:33,040 --> 01:17:34,620
Check to see if we
 succeed in shocking

2407
01:17:34,620 --> 01:17:35,920
the moon from its orbit.

2408
01:17:35,920 --> 01:17:39,410
-Uh, I'm still trying
 to microwave my burrito.

2409
01:17:39,410 --> 01:17:41,470
-Start the bombardment.

2410
01:17:41,470 --> 01:17:42,440
-What bombardment?

2411
01:17:45,310 --> 01:17:45,810
[GASP]

2412
01:17:45,810 --> 01:17:47,080
-Ooh!

2413
01:17:47,080 --> 01:17:49,570
Aah!

2414
01:17:49,570 --> 01:17:51,060
Aah!

2415
01:17:51,060 --> 01:17:53,510
-Two missles, direct
 on target, Professor.

2416
01:17:53,510 --> 01:17:55,270
Report results, please.

2417
01:17:55,270 --> 01:17:57,320
-It went boom.

2418
01:17:57,320 --> 01:18:00,130
-The course of Posita is still
 absolute, without deviation,

2419
01:18:00,130 --> 01:18:00,630
Rocky.

2420
01:18:00,630 --> 01:18:01,460
-What do you know.

2421
01:18:01,460 --> 01:18:02,680
-Fire again.

2422
01:18:02,680 --> 01:18:03,650
Again and again.

2423
01:18:03,650 --> 01:18:04,300
-Whoa, whoa!

2424
01:18:04,300 --> 01:18:06,620
Slow down little lady.

2425
01:18:06,620 --> 01:18:08,130
-It's something to do.

2426
01:18:08,130 --> 01:18:08,920
Don't cost nothing.

2427
01:18:08,920 --> 01:18:09,900
-OK.

2428
01:18:09,900 --> 01:18:10,400
-Ooh!

2429
01:18:10,400 --> 01:18:12,380
Ooh, Ooh!

2430
01:18:12,380 --> 01:18:14,360
-You can't blow up a Cocoa Puff.

2431
01:18:14,360 --> 01:18:15,790
To this-- there's just no way.

2432
01:18:19,200 --> 01:18:20,840
-We're dry of
 missiles, Professor.

2433
01:18:20,840 --> 01:18:21,620
What's your reading?

2434
01:18:21,620 --> 01:18:24,980
-"The Beauty Myth."

2435
01:18:24,980 --> 01:18:27,050
-Posita does not show
 the slightest deviation

2436
01:18:27,050 --> 01:18:28,170
from course, Rocky.

2437
01:18:28,170 --> 01:18:29,510
-But I do.

2438
01:18:29,510 --> 01:18:30,840
-It must not be!

2439
01:18:30,840 --> 01:18:32,990
-The crash of moons is
 something that was meant to be,

2440
01:18:32,990 --> 01:18:33,490
Cleolanta.

2441
01:18:33,490 --> 01:18:34,340
We can't stop.

2442
01:18:34,340 --> 01:18:34,850
-It's karma.

2443
01:18:37,410 --> 01:18:39,480
-Ophecian spaceship
 to Orbit Jet.

2444
01:18:39,480 --> 01:18:40,450
Rocky Jones to Winky.

2445
01:18:40,450 --> 01:18:41,420
Come in.

2446
01:18:41,420 --> 01:18:42,450
-I'm in a meeting.

2447
01:18:42,450 --> 01:18:44,810
-Ophecian spaceship
 to Orbit Jet.

2448
01:18:44,810 --> 01:18:45,760
-Ask nicely.

2449
01:18:45,760 --> 01:18:48,700
-Mr. Secretary, Rocky
 Jones is calling in.

2450
01:18:48,700 --> 01:18:50,450
I'm with you, Roc,
 what's your report?

2451
01:18:50,450 --> 01:18:52,300
-Uh, don't go in
 there for a while.

2452
01:18:52,300 --> 01:18:55,450
-The evacuated moon, Posita
 failed to show results.

2453
01:18:55,450 --> 01:18:58,680
Collision with Ophecious
 on the 19th is absolute.

2454
01:18:58,680 --> 01:19:00,600
-Well, it figured, Rocky.

2455
01:19:00,600 --> 01:19:01,480
Mr. Secretary.

2456
01:19:01,480 --> 01:19:02,450
-Give me that pinkle Winky.

2457
01:19:02,450 --> 01:19:04,180
-I've alerted all of the
 spaceships in the vicinity.

2458
01:19:04,180 --> 01:19:05,160
-Winkle Wink.

2459
01:19:05,160 --> 01:19:06,600
-The fleet will now
 go to Ophecious.

2460
01:19:06,600 --> 01:19:07,820
-Look, he's got antelope horns.

2461
01:19:07,820 --> 01:19:08,650
Ha, ha.

2462
01:19:08,650 --> 01:19:12,150
-Cleolanta will be glad to
 hear that, Mr. Secretary.

2463
01:19:12,150 --> 01:19:15,340
-A land, a world, where
 shall I think my people?

2464
01:19:15,340 --> 01:19:17,240
-Please, Cleolanta, give
 us your cooperation.

2465
01:19:17,240 --> 01:19:20,110
We'll do everything possible.

2466
01:19:20,110 --> 01:19:20,990
Now Rocky--

2467
01:19:20,990 --> 01:19:22,220
-It's a plot of United Worlds.

2468
01:19:22,220 --> 01:19:25,020
It's a trick to make the
 Ophecious a lost race.

2469
01:19:25,020 --> 01:19:25,600
-Atlasan.

2470
01:19:25,600 --> 01:19:26,400
There's no time to lose.

2471
01:19:26,400 --> 01:19:28,050
There are plans to made.

2472
01:19:28,050 --> 01:19:28,760
it's a plot!

2473
01:19:28,760 --> 01:19:29,570
A trick!

2474
01:19:29,570 --> 01:19:30,510
-A female trick.

2475
01:19:30,510 --> 01:19:32,560
-Yes, Mr. Secretary?

2476
01:19:32,560 --> 01:19:34,960
-Rocky, you will arrive
 on Ophecious first.

2477
01:19:34,960 --> 01:19:35,460
-OK.

2478
01:19:35,460 --> 01:19:36,630
-The people must
 be warned and told

2479
01:19:36,630 --> 01:19:38,820
to prepare for the evacuation.

2480
01:19:38,820 --> 01:19:41,500
If there is a panic,
 everything is lost.

2481
01:19:41,500 --> 01:19:42,410
-Yes, Mr. Secretary.

2482
01:19:42,410 --> 01:19:44,190
-Yeah, disavow
 this, Mr. Secretary.

2483
01:19:44,190 --> 01:19:47,950
-And I have a good
 partner for the job.

2484
01:19:47,950 --> 01:19:48,450
-Ha, aha.

2485
01:19:48,450 --> 01:19:49,620
-All right, this
 must be the end.

2486
01:19:49,620 --> 01:19:50,210
-Ah, right!
 -Yay!

2487
01:19:50,210 --> 01:19:50,710
It's over!

2488
01:19:50,710 --> 01:19:51,440
-I kind of liked that.

2489
01:19:51,440 --> 01:19:52,320
It was really fun.

2490
01:19:52,320 --> 01:19:53,670
-Yay!

2491
01:19:53,670 --> 01:19:54,570
-Uh-oh.

2492
01:19:54,570 --> 01:19:55,870
-I guess they're
 travelling, huh?

2493
01:19:55,870 --> 01:19:56,370
-Oh, gee!

2494
01:19:56,370 --> 01:19:58,850
For crying out loud.

2495
01:19:58,850 --> 01:19:59,350
-Ach!

2496
01:19:59,350 --> 01:20:00,700
-OK, say cheese, everyone.

2497
01:20:00,700 --> 01:20:02,230
-If you wish, Rocky,
 I'll blast down the ship.

2498
01:20:02,230 --> 01:20:02,970
I know the fields.

2499
01:20:02,970 --> 01:20:03,650
-Go ahead, Atlasan.

2500
01:20:03,650 --> 01:20:05,240
-(IMITATING STEWIE) Oh,
 suddenly, we're friends?

2501
01:20:10,380 --> 01:20:11,810
[SIGH]

2502
01:20:11,810 --> 01:20:14,860
-Oh, uh, OK now, Mrs. Webb,
 uh, we're-- we're gonna--

2503
01:20:14,860 --> 01:20:16,730
we're gonna turn
 around here, OK?

2504
01:20:16,730 --> 01:20:18,030
No, no, no, Mrs. Webb!

2505
01:20:18,030 --> 01:20:21,510
Uh, oh!

2506
01:20:21,510 --> 01:20:24,930
-Devo, new traditionalists.

2507
01:20:24,930 --> 01:20:25,780
-Colonel Puppy Paws.

2508
01:20:27,800 --> 01:20:29,230
-(IMITATING DUDLEY
 DOORIGHT) Nell, come in!

2509
01:20:32,040 --> 01:20:35,450
-Fort Apache, the
 Bronx, by Marx.

2510
01:20:35,450 --> 01:20:36,670
-Hey, you know,
 you just can't get

2511
01:20:36,670 --> 01:20:39,200
enough of these
 here shots, can ya?

2512
01:20:39,200 --> 01:20:41,650
-Let's milk this dry, huh?

2513
01:20:47,520 --> 01:20:48,450
-A spaceship.

2514
01:20:48,450 --> 01:20:49,520
-Oh, no duh!

2515
01:20:49,520 --> 01:20:50,600
-This is our chance to escape.

2516
01:20:50,600 --> 01:20:52,910
-Whoop!

2517
01:20:52,910 --> 01:20:54,780
-You've given the
 orders, Rocky Jones.

2518
01:20:54,780 --> 01:20:55,280
-Mm, hm.

2519
01:20:55,280 --> 01:20:57,290
-But now as Susareign
 of Ophecious,

2520
01:20:57,290 --> 01:21:01,400
I demand the right to
 speak to my people, alone!

2521
01:21:01,400 --> 01:21:02,760
-Ooh!

2522
01:21:02,760 --> 01:21:05,820
-What he lacks in expression,
 he makes up for with hat tips.

2523
01:21:05,820 --> 01:21:08,780
-I must respect your leadership.

2524
01:21:08,780 --> 01:21:09,670
-Atlasan.

2525
01:21:09,670 --> 01:21:11,020
-Look, my name's Gary, OK?

2526
01:21:14,590 --> 01:21:16,690
-She really sucked the
 air out of the room.

2527
01:21:16,690 --> 01:21:17,190
-Every time.

2528
01:21:25,660 --> 01:21:27,960
-Your USC Trojans!

2529
01:21:27,960 --> 01:21:29,180
-Ba-ba-ba- bah-ba bop.

2530
01:21:32,550 --> 01:21:33,050
-Ping.

2531
01:21:33,050 --> 01:21:36,470
-All right, now is our chance.

2532
01:21:36,470 --> 01:21:36,970
-Hm, hm, hm.

2533
01:21:36,970 --> 01:21:38,940
Hm, hm.

2534
01:21:38,940 --> 01:21:39,440
Hmm.

2535
01:21:39,440 --> 01:21:41,480
-Hey, it's me, your queen!

2536
01:21:41,480 --> 01:21:43,580
-General wrestle with
 the queen, only $2.

2537
01:21:47,530 --> 01:21:53,100
-Yeah, this has all the earmarks
 of a run on the bank, to me.

2538
01:21:53,100 --> 01:21:54,280
-Uh, I've got $2.

2539
01:21:54,280 --> 01:21:55,990
I'll wrestle the queen.

2540
01:21:55,990 --> 01:21:56,810
Definitely.

2541
01:21:56,810 --> 01:21:58,040
Mm, hm.

2542
01:21:58,040 --> 01:21:58,650
-Blast off!

2543
01:21:58,650 --> 01:22:00,250
Take us away from Ophecious.

2544
01:22:00,250 --> 01:22:00,960
-Oh yeah?

2545
01:22:00,960 --> 01:22:03,940
Well take this, Puppy Paws.

2546
01:22:03,940 --> 01:22:07,860
-Suddenly, it Guns
 N Roses concert.

2547
01:22:07,860 --> 01:22:08,920
-Wrestle the queen?

2548
01:22:08,920 --> 01:22:09,500
Why I oughta--

2549
01:22:14,210 --> 01:22:14,920
-Harold, come on.

2550
01:22:14,920 --> 01:22:15,790
Don't cause trouble.

2551
01:22:15,790 --> 01:22:17,640
Why don't we just
 take our seats.

2552
01:22:17,640 --> 01:22:19,830
-Jeez, these flight
 attendants are tough!

2553
01:22:19,830 --> 01:22:23,230
-Wouldn't it be more productive
 if they did this to Winky?

2554
01:22:23,230 --> 01:22:24,150
-Stop!

2555
01:22:24,150 --> 01:22:25,070
I command it!

2556
01:22:25,070 --> 01:22:25,990
Stop!

2557
01:22:25,990 --> 01:22:27,380
-Ooh!

2558
01:22:27,380 --> 01:22:30,180
Now is my chance to
 be a real radio DJ.

2559
01:22:30,180 --> 01:22:32,760
-Please, this is
 Trinka, your friend.

2560
01:22:32,760 --> 01:22:33,260
-Trinket?

2561
01:22:33,260 --> 01:22:36,970
-I won't command,
 but listen to me.

2562
01:22:36,970 --> 01:22:38,770
You all know what
 is going to happen.

2563
01:22:38,770 --> 01:22:40,140
You have a right to be afraid.

2564
01:22:40,140 --> 01:22:42,640
But we have fine friends
 who will help us.

2565
01:22:42,640 --> 01:22:43,390
-Hm.

2566
01:22:43,390 --> 01:22:45,860
-If you all behave
 in an orderly manner,

2567
01:22:45,860 --> 01:22:48,160
United Worlds will
 see that everyone

2568
01:22:48,160 --> 01:22:50,440
is evacuated by the 19th.

2569
01:22:50,440 --> 01:22:50,940
-Yeah.

2570
01:22:50,940 --> 01:22:51,440
Boys!

2571
01:22:51,440 --> 01:22:52,950
-That little lady
 makes a lot of sense.

2572
01:22:52,950 --> 01:22:53,450
-That's right.

2573
01:22:53,450 --> 01:22:53,950
-Wow!

2574
01:22:53,950 --> 01:22:55,190
-So go back there.

2575
01:22:55,190 --> 01:22:56,730
-Sorry I hit you, Bob.

2576
01:22:56,730 --> 01:22:58,740
-That would hurt
 from down there.

2577
01:22:58,740 --> 01:23:01,600
-Lunch today will be
 tomato soup, tater tots,

2578
01:23:01,600 --> 01:23:03,020
and pudding in a cloud.

2579
01:23:03,020 --> 01:23:04,500
-Horowitz is visibly shaken.

2580
01:23:04,500 --> 01:23:06,310
-Mm, hm.

2581
01:23:06,310 --> 01:23:10,660
-All right, lets us
 wrestle the queen, now.

2582
01:23:10,660 --> 01:23:11,820
-Hey, snappy pantsuit.

2583
01:23:15,540 --> 01:23:17,630
-Well, America's Crummiest
 Home Videos, huh?

2584
01:23:20,570 --> 01:23:28,410
[THUNDER]

2585
01:23:28,410 --> 01:23:30,060
-You said I was brave, Atlasan.

2586
01:23:30,060 --> 01:23:31,110
But I-- I'm not.

2587
01:23:31,110 --> 01:23:31,820
I'm frightened.

2588
01:23:31,820 --> 01:23:33,380
-You smell like
 cheese curls, honey.

2589
01:23:33,380 --> 01:23:34,950
-We still have 5 days.

2590
01:23:34,950 --> 01:23:40,900
[BEEPING]

2591
01:23:40,900 --> 01:23:43,280
-Orbit Jet to Ophecious.

2592
01:23:43,280 --> 01:23:45,000
Vena to whoever
 will answer this.

2593
01:23:45,000 --> 01:23:46,440
(SINGING) Who will answer?

2594
01:23:46,440 --> 01:23:47,470
Who will answer?

2595
01:23:47,470 --> 01:23:49,140
-I sure hope it's you, Rocky.

